<title>USA: Ensco Q3 shr including gain rises to $0.38.</title>
<headline>Ensco Q3 shr including gain rises to $0.38.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.38		    $0.27</p>
<p> Net			 27,212		   16,280</p>
<p> Revs		     134,588		   71,793</p>
